flowchart TD
  N[Network state]
  N -->|Online| V[Server validation]
  N -->|Slow / unstable| Q[Stable request key + bounded retry]
  N -->|Offline| D[Non-regulated draft only]
  Q --> V
  V -->|Confirmed| C[Commit + audit]
  V -->|Timeout / uncertain| H[Manual review]
  D -->|Reconnect| X[Conflict check]
  X -->|Safe and approved| C
  X -->|Conflict or regulated| H
  G[Sale / invoice / prescription / inventory mutation] --> Z[Blocked offline]
